tftp 192.168.50.1

Then at the tftp prompt:

tftp> binary
tftp> trace
tftp> rexmt 1
tftp> timeout 60
tftp> put /path/to/your-file.itb

rexmt 1 sets retransmit timeout to 1 second which keeps the transfer alive against U-Boot's short ACK window. trace shows packet-level progress so you can see it's actually moving.

