# Should have: 192.168.50.0/24 dev enp3s0

If nothing responds, the router didn't enter recovery mode — power cycle and repeat the reset hold. The timing window is tight: hold reset, apply power, hold for the slow blink, then release. Letting go too early or too late misses the window.

