efi-updatevar -f /tmp/dbxupdate.bin dbx

If the "failed to load system dbx" message persists after repopulating, it's cosmetic — some Dell BIOSes log that warning whenever dbx was ever empty during a boot cycle, and it clears after the next full power cycle (not just reboot — full power off, wait 10 seconds, power on).

