Two separate questions — let me get the prpl IP first:
Searched the web

prpl_haze doesn't have widely documented default IP info in public sources — it's a carrier/developer reference platform, not a consumer device. Let me address both issues directly:

prpl_haze default IP — best known values:

prplOS is built on OpenWrt and the Haze platform uses standard prplOS defaults:

    LAN: 192.168.1.1
    SSH: root@192.168.1.1 port 22
    No default password (empty) or root depending on build variant

If that doesn't respond, use tcpdump to catch what it actually advertises:
bash

