If network is completely dead, serial is the only guaranteed path in. The AX89X has a UART header on the board:

    Baud: 115200 8N1
    Pinout: GND, TX, RX (no flow control)
    Need a USB-to-UART adapter (CH340, CP2102, or FTDI)

