bash

# Edit the DTS
nano prpl_haze.dts

Find the chosen { node and add bootargs:

chosen {
    stdout-path = "serial0:115200n8";
    bootargs = "ip=192.168.1.1::192.168.1.254:255.255.255.0:prplhaze:eth0:off";
};

That ip= format is the kernel's built-in network config: ip=<device-ip>::<gateway>:<netmask>:<hostname>:<interface>:off

