Wanna know how i saw those binary files? It was interesting it even worked. I was trying to get the data from each device in /sys/bus/hid/devices , but didnt want to have to awk each directory name from a file to do it, so i tried this , cd /sys/bus/hid/devices/* & cat * | less . And omg you should see it, those are only a few pics from earlier i sent you
