The /bin/[ file is the test command — it's a standard Unix binary, [ is literally an alias for test used in shell scripts like if [ condition ]. It's supposed to be there.

However — "Converted from Mac format" at the bottom is not normal. That means the file has Mac line endings (CR or CRLF) or was transferred/modified on a Mac and the conversion marker was left. A system binary should never have that. That's a red flag.
