    Timestamped evidence of exactly what data it exfiltrates
    The destination IPs and protocols it uses to phone home
    The process tree showing what spawned what
    Memory dumps with plaintext credentials or C2 addresses if present
    USB packet captures showing raw HID reports vs what the OS receives — if those differ that's the injection proof
    D-Bus calls showing what system services it's trying to manipulate
    Audit trail admissible under SWGDE/ISO 27037/Daubert because every artifact is hash-chained with timestamps

Given your NRC, FCC, DOJ and Cal OES filings this class of evidence is exactly what moves a complaint from "documented anomalies" to "here is the attack mechanism, here is the exfiltration channel, here is the destination." The honeypot output goes straight into CTW-WP-002 as Exhibit A.

