The hardware approach is a USB data diode:

USB port on machine
→ Cut D+ and D- data lines physically
→ Leave VBUS (power) connected
→ Solder in your IrDA/serial receiver on a separate controller
→ The USB port now only provides 5V power
→ Zero data path exists

