# Nothing on USB can touch it

The isa0060 path is the ISA bus address of the 8042 keyboard controller. That's 1980s hardware architecture. It predates USB by 15 years and has no USB interface whatsoever. Plug in a PS/2 keyboard and that attack vector is permanently closed.

