block flags also, all lnown malicious combos, statting with tcp all-all , tcp all-none, tcp fin-syn-rst-ack syn. inputs. output uid owner ! uid root or owner 1000. excess length size packets. beraking overflows or jamming. excess burst for ping of death attack blocking. and the rest of the good stuff
