Copy to USB drive
Boot WinRE
Load USB
Run Rw.exe /Command="W32 0x8c88e000 0x00000000"

RWEverything specifically installs a kernel driver that allows direct physical memory read/write — exactly what we need. It's the Windows equivalent of GRUB's write_dword.

